# Contract Validation in Plain English
# Quotes for specific terms, Capitalization for defined terms

Load document

# Check for required clauses using natural language
Document must contain "liability clause"
Document must contain Termination Clause
Document should have Intellectual Property Rights

# Extract key financial terms
Find liability cap and save as liability_cap
Find contract value and save as contract_value
Find termination notice and save as termination_days

# Validate extracted amounts
liability_cap must be at least 1000000
contract_value must be at least 10000
termination_days must be at least 30
